  "items": [
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 392115417,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_6_658-748",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "658-748",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人世间最难的事情莫过于面临选择而无法取舍。选择了林荫小路，就放弃了阳光大道；选择了欣赏奇景，就放弃了平坦旅途；选择了重新开始，就放弃了曾经拥有；选择了奔赴远方，就放弃了现世安稳……",
      "totalCount": 1224
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 381351287,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_6_2980-3020",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "2980-3020",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人生的烦恼，从来不因为你的出身、你的职业而有所不同，生活原本不易，烦恼无处不在。",
      "totalCount": 1184
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 339915873,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_7115-7166",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "7115-7166",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "真正的陪伴，是心灵在同一个频道上。亲密的人心灵不在一个频道上，就会形成一种悲伤，这种悲伤叫作无人能懂。",
      "totalCount": 976
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 205827941,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_12944-12982",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "12944-12982",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "正如南怀瑾先生所说：“三千年读史，不外功名利禄。九万里悟道，终归诗酒田园。”",
      "totalCount": 954
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 79352510,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_6_12160-12226",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "12160-12226",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不为出身、长相、智力、家庭、生活环境这些无法选择的事情而烦恼，自己去选择面对生活的态度，内心拥有丰富的平静，就会拥有战胜一切的力量。",
      "totalCount": 954
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 234620761,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_7415-7435",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "7415-7435",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "但向己求，莫从他觅，觅即不得，得亦不真。",
      "totalCount": 850
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 445837619,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_11_6039-6102",
      "chapterUid": 11,
      "range": "6039-6102",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "岐王宅里寻常见，崔九堂前几度闻。 正是江南好风景，落花时节又逢君。",
      "totalCount": 832
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 210239563,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_2717-2780",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "2717-2780",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "写文章，技巧是次要的，关键是要有一颗热爱生活的“心”。一个人的内心是否有力量，不是看你忙的时候做什么，而是看你闲的时候做什么。",
      "totalCount": 812
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 28330680,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_5562-5622",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "5562-5622",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "少年不识愁滋味，爱上层楼。爱上层楼，为赋新词强(qiǎng)说愁。　如今识得愁滋味，欲说还休。欲说还休，却道天凉好个秋。",
      "totalCount": 731
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 12208433,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_2008-2071",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "2008-2071",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "黄梅时节家家雨，青草池塘处处蛙。 有约不来过夜半，闲敲棋子落灯花。",
      "totalCount": 728
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 294336837,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_5180-5228",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "5180-5228",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "鲁迅先生说过：“猛兽总是独行，只有牛羊才成群结队。”做猛兽还是做牛羊，都没有错，只是个人的选择。",
      "totalCount": 602
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 917168038,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_10658-10747",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "10658-10747",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "有些人做事很认真，凡事一定要争个是非曲直。可是有时候，事实有那么重要吗？情理、情理，为什么“情”在前，“理”在后呢？如果不是原则问题，不是特别重大的问题，实在没有必要那么较真儿。",
      "totalCount": 585
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 416168774,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_6_871-892",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "871-892",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "纠结，不是不知道该怎样做，而是舍不得放弃。",
      "totalCount": 578
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 87330316,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_11736-11778",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "11736-11778",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "和爱人，不争对错；和亲人，不争输赢；和朋友，不争得失。这是智慧，更是内心深处的善良。",
      "totalCount": 576
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 18064846,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_3287-3316",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "3287-3316",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "拥有一颗诗意的心，就是诗词给每个人面对无聊单调生活的力量。",
      "totalCount": 572
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 330025010,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_5_8369-8381",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "8369-8381",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "恐惧的结果，往往是伤害。",
      "totalCount": 544
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 396669954,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_22_5682-5753",
      "chapterUid": 22,
      "range": "5682-5753",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "身体健康，才能保证生命的质量；多活几年，才能拥有生命的重量。百味人生须尽欢，一樽江湖醉风月。多一些前半生的随遇而安，就会拥有后半生的天高云淡。",
      "totalCount": 527
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 315923112,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_19_10384-10415",
      "chapterUid": 19,
      "range": "10384-10415",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如何才能获得人生的圆满？途径有二：对外自我实现，对内自我和解。",
      "totalCount": 504
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 576212026,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_6_4147-4205",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "4147-4205",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "愿在衣而为领，承华首之余芳；悲罗襟之宵离，怨秋夜之未央。愿在裳而为带，束窈窕之纤身；嗟温凉之异气，或脱故而服新……”",
      "totalCount": 496
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300062702",
      "userVid": 382931213,
      "bookmarkId": "3300062702_6_10612-10645",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "10612-10645",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“纵浪大化中，不喜亦不惧。应尽便须尽，无复独多虑”（《形影神》）。",
      "totalCount": 468
    }
